</div>
<section id="scene-1" class="scene" data-start="0" data-duration="5" data-track-index="2">
<h1 id="opening-title" class="heading">一个网格，一次低买高卖</h1><div id="initial">初始：现金100元｜持仓0份</div>
</section>
<section id="scene-2" class="scene" data-start="5" data-duration="6" data-track-index="3">
<h2 id="buy-heading" class="heading">到90元，买入1份</h2>
</section>
