<div id="sell-label" class="trade-label" data-track-index="6" data-scene-ids="scene-3 scene-4">卖出这1份</div>
<div id="holding" data-track-index="7" data-scene-ids="scene-2 scene-3"><svg viewBox="0 0 132 56" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="128" height="52" rx="12" fill="#F6F4EE" stroke="#175DB5" stroke-width="2"/></svg><span>这1份</span></div>
